description:
Add a tag to one of your Nekoweb sites. Sites can have a limited number of tags (usually 10); remove one with nekoweb_remove_tag to make room.

Requires the optional session token (NEKOWEB_SESSION_TOKEN). If it isn't set, this tool returns setup steps to pass on to the user. Tag changes are rate limited to about 20 per 15 minutes.

Example: "Tag my site as pixel art" -> { tag: "pixel-art" }
